    <!-- 📜 Privacy Policy -->
    <string name="privacy_policy_full_text">
        Privacy Policy
        \n
        This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information. By using this application, you agree to the terms of this policy.
        \n
        1. Information Collection
        We may collect the following information:
        \n
        Information you provide directly (such as name, email, and other optional data).
        \n
        Technical information about your device (such as device model, operating system, and app version) to improve performance.
        \n
        Data about your usage of the app (such as pages visited or buttons clicked) collected anonymously.
        \n
        2. Use of Information
        We use the collected information for the following purposes:
        \n
        To provide and improve the app’s services. To respond to requests and user support. To analyze and optimize the user experience.
        \n
        3. Information Sharing
        We do not sell or rent your personal information to any third party, except in the following cases:
        \n
        With your explicit consent. When required by law or legal authorities. To provide services through trusted partners (such as advertising or analytics services) who will have access to the data only as necessary.
        \n
        4. Information Security
        \n
        We take necessary security measures to protect your information against unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure. However, no method of data transmission or storage is 100% secure.
        \n
        5. Changes to Privacy Policy
        \n
        We may update this policy from time to time. The updated version will be available through the app or website, and the date of the last update will be noted at the bottom of this page.
        \n
        6. Contact Us
        \n
        If you have any questions or concerns about this policy, you can contact us via the email below:
        \n
        [mshajkarami@gmail.com]
        \n
        Last Updated: 2025/07/31
    </string>

